flowchart LR
  subgraph APP[APPLICATION / SIMULATED SEED DATA]
    M[Majlis governance workflow]
    H[Canonical parameter hash]
    M --> H
  end
  GAP{{PROPOSED ONLY<br/>No verified on-chain handoff}}
  H -. no transaction writer .-> GAP
  GAP -. absent .-> R
  subgraph CHAIN[ARBITRUM SEPOLIA / LIVE READ ONLY]
    R[Gravitas Policy Registry]
    V2[Teleport V2<br/>same-chain LP migration]
    V3[Teleport V3<br/>signed position migration]
    TL[GravitasTimelock]
    V2 -->|Registry checks| R
    V3 -->|Registry checks| R
    TL -. owner not handed over .-> R
  end
  subgraph TEST[LOCAL EVM / TESTS]
    F[Foundry suite and test mocks]
    E[Transaction receipts and assertions]
    F --> E
  end
  V2 -. tested locally .-> F
  V3 -. tested locally .-> F
  style GAP fill:#f6eddb,stroke:#8a5b0d,color:#422e0b
  style R fill:#e5eee9,stroke:#174d3b
